# Tend the Sprigs: "if you control seven or more lands and/or Treefolk" is asked after the search (CR 608.2c). On turn 9 Bot1 has five Forests and a Great Forest Druid (a Treefolk): the
# land the search finds makes seven, and the 3/4 Treefolk token with reach comes. Without the Druid, or counting before the search, it would be six.

[Bot1 Deck]
Tend the Sprigs
Great Forest Druid
Forest x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T9 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Great Forest Druid.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#3.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#4.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#5.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Tend the Sprigs.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Search(Forest)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 8
Bot1.Battlefield.Treefolk Token.Power = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Treefolk Token.Toughness = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Treefolk Token.Keywords = Reach
